      "message": "Minor preference for this to be WEBP_BIDI_INDEXABLE or WEBP_INDEXABLE. \n\nMy ideal state for these changes is that we\u0027ll remove  `WEBP_ASSUME_UNSAFE_INDEXABLE_ABI` at the top of the file once the files are done, in which case, these annotations will become redundant. Having it marked as indexable/bidi_indexable reads to me as redundant on a local, whereas the sized_by feels more intentional,\n\nHappy to be overriden by James here or other webp owners :)",
